                                "sense_id": "9458ad67-102b-3cec-9755-4fd33d5b8d93",
                                "text": "Все смеются — и откровенно, и нарочито громко."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1430e7c-cb23-335c-ac33-7f03fc5034e2",
                        "entry_id": "09b895f7-e631-3b9b-88af-2334aca2e33f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. значительно, заметно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a46bf6b-d4f5-4d9d-924c-c6024618d9be",
                                "sense_id": "c1430e7c-cb23-335c-ac33-7f03fc5034e2",
                                "text": "За Горьким ериком, верстах в пяти, протекает нарочито большая река шириной сажен на пятнадцать, называемая Хары Хаза…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ee9fb2a-0611-4098-a772-7e78d4868883",
                        "source_entry_id": "09b895f7-e631-3b9b-88af-2334aca2e33f",
                        "target_lang_word": "markedly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "markedly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "836b5c35-1cf4-3015-83a9-a423350a30e8",
                                        "entry_id": "7710b51b-a499-3be6-9fda-8ac68ae8e3e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a marked manner; distinctly, noticeably, conspicuously."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cdaf453-253d-4ca4-8400-cfaf8c275632",
                                                "sense_id": "836b5c35-1cf4-3015-83a9-a423350a30e8",
                                                "text": "Being markedly different as a teenager can get you taunted; as an adult it can make you famous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aec6484a-b5ca-42f9-9426-6a2df497205a",
                                                "sense_id": "836b5c35-1cf4-3015-83a9-a423350a30e8",
                                                "text": "Nearer the coast, the land becomes markedly more marshy, with long, winding channels striking inland from the sea, making access to some of the waterside villages rather difficult."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "512917fd-8d42-4869-a4e3-257775749ac8",
                                                "sense_id": "836b5c35-1cf4-3015-83a9-a423350a30e8",
                                                "text": "Developments were markedly different in the Soviet zone, but ultimately ended in perhaps an even grimmer dead end: that of SED leader Walter Ulbricht’s thoroughly Stalinized German Democratic Republic (GDR)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a1040af-9121-4fc8-9715-118fbed1142a",
                        "source_entry_id": "09b895f7-e631-3b9b-88af-2334aca2e33f",
